# Scenario 'register_errors': initial registration under faults. Every attempt starts with `wipe` (fresh cartridge: save RAM 0xFF, adapter
# configuration blank, then a power cycle) and walks the wizard of 'register' up to the connection check ("通信開始確認" -> はい), with one fault
# set through `net` first: DNS NXDOMAIN, DNS timeout, TCP refused, TCP reset, POP3 failing at connect / USER / PASS / STAT, adapter unplugged
# during the dial. Extra attempts: the second password entry differs from the first (mismatch message, then the correct one), and B (もどる)
# pressed on the wizard pages and on the confirmation. The last attempt has no fault and finishes the registration (to leave a
# registered state). Fake Internet with latency 2 frames. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
# --- attempt dns_nx
wipe
wait 400
gap 20
net dns=nx
tap A                        # "初期登録開始" (start initial registration)
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "初期登録のご注意" 1/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # 2/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # 3/3
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "料金のご注意"
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A                        # "ログインID入力" example screen
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A x10                    # 10 digits '1' -> field full, auto-advances to mail address
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A
waitstable 40 max 100
tap A x8                     # local part (8 chars) ...
tap A x4                     # ... then sub-domain part (4 chars) -> cursor jumps to OK
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 40 max 200
tap A
waitstable 40 max 100
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START                    # jump to OK
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
# re-enter the same password
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300

tap A                        # はい (save password)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # はい (summary)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot dns_nx_connect_confirm
tap A                        # はい: dial
wait 2500
shot dns_nx_result
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot dns_nx_after
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot dns_nx_after2
net dns=ok
